{"id":"wb-7-988","name":"瑞隆感应塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"瑞隆感应塔","text":"瑞隆感应塔位于浙江省台州市黄岩区东城街道九峰山下。塔建于五代吴越建隆四年（963年），塔高35.2米，共七层，平面八边形，为砖木结构仿楼阁式砖塔。1982年2月公布为黄岩县县级重点文物保护单位，1997年8月29日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%91%9E%E9%9A%86%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94%E5%A1%94","revisionId":87479233,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87479233","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b573252a7bd6d43b78c3459e.jpg","title":"瑞隆感应塔,_2022-02-14_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%91%9E%E9%9A%86%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94%E5%A1%94,_2022-02-14_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/%E7%91%9E%E9%9A%86%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94%E5%A1%94%2C_2022-02-14_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​黄岩瑞隆感应塔","width":320,"height":479}}